t.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-03-05T04:08:03Z","updated_at":"2021-03-05T04:08:03Z","body":"feel free to experiment with this,which seems to be the issue\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n\r\ndiff --git a/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/descriptor_props.py b/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/descriptor_props.py\r\nindex 65fe58e61..41788071e 100644\r\n--- a/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/descriptor_props.py\r\n+++ b/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/descriptor_props.py\r\n@@ -271,8 +271,10 @@ class CompositeProperty(DescriptorProperty):\r\n         def load_handler(state, *args):\r\n             _load_refresh_handler(state, args, is_refresh=False)\r\n \r\n-        def refresh_handler(state, *args):\r\n-            _load_refresh_handler(state, args, is_refresh=True)\r\n+        def refresh_handler(state, context, to_load):\r\n+            # note this corresponds to sqlalchemy.ext.mutable load_attrs()\r\n+            if not to_load or set(self._attribute_keys).intersection(to_load):\r\n+                _load_refresh_handler(state, (context, to_load), is_refresh=True)\r\n \r\n         def _load_refresh_handler(state, args, is_refresh):\r\n             dict_ = state.dict\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy